hadiths[7]{hadithnumber,text}:
"119","Hamein Qutaibah ibn Said ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Laith ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Amr ibn al-Harith se, unhon ne Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn Qusait se, unhon ne Said ibn al-Musayyib se riwayat kiya ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne zakat al-fitr do mudd gandum muqarrar farmayi."
"120","Hamein Qutaibah ibn Said ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Laith ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ibn Khalid se - yani Ibn Musafir - unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Said ibn al-Musayyib se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne zakat al-fitr do mudd gandum muqarrar farmayi."
"121","Qutaibah ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Laith ne humein khabar di, Uqail se, Ibn Shihab se, Saeed ibn al-Musayyib se, Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se isi tarah."
"122","Yaqub ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, Hushaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Agar maine ise al-Zuhri se na suna ho to Sufyan ibn Husain ne mujhe ise al-Zuhri se khabar di, unhon ne Saeed ibn al-Musayyib se, unhon ne Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se isi maana ke saath riwayat kiya."
"123","Abdullah ibn al-Jarrah ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Zaid ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Abi Hafsah se, al-Zuhri se, Saeed ibn al-Musayyib se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne zakat al-fitr ka hukm diya, isi maana ke saath."
"124","Muhammad ibn Ubaid ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Zaid ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdul Khaliq al-Shaibani ne hum se bayan kiya, Saeed ibn al-Musayyib se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam), Hazrat Abu Bakr aur Hazrat Umar ke daur me sadqah aadha sa gehon tha. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shubah aur Bishr ibn al-Mufaddal ne ise Abdul Khaliq se isi tarah riwayat kiya."
"125","Nasr ibn Asim al-Antaki ne hum se bayan kiya, ke Anas ibn Iyad ne unhein al-Harith se khabar di - yaani Ibn Abd al-Rahman - unhon ne kaha: Maine Saeed ibn al-Musayyib se poocha: Kya charwahon aur kheti ke mazdooron par zakat al-fitr wajib hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, ye to bas zakat al-fitr hai; Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne hukm diya ke ise chhote aur bade, aazad aur ghulam, charwahon aur kheti ke mazdooron ki taraf se ada kiya jaye."
